'''Bones''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Halloween box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is solid black with a ribcage of bones imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is bone white, and the handle is solid black with a bone imprinted on it.

